{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026f194vxJQrG1795507778.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>本港上月錄得約513萬人次旅客訪港，按年升一成二。</p><p></p><p>其中上月有近400萬人次內地旅客訪港，按年升一成半，海外旅客亦升百分之2。相關數字亦帶動餐飲、零售等行業。旅發局指，上月適逢印度長周末假期，及本港、大灣區會展活動帶動，長途市場旅客大幅升一成九、達44萬人次，新市場更急增三成七。</p><p></p><p>今年首10個月，有近4,600萬人次旅客訪港，按年升一成二。文體旅局局長羅淑佩早前已指，有信心達政府估算、即全年5,380萬人次旅客，按年升百分之8的目標。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T09:04:03.218957+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":219,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T04:53:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T00:57:14.323343+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T08:57:17.988774+00:00","content_hash":"75eba32dc8bb0544e1d28dddf744130baebc311860226a759666481365345dd5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T09:04:03.218957+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}